    "title": "Emmy Noether: Modern LaTeX Working Corpus and Multilingual Translation Drafts (R816 / Integrated v18 Source-Control Update)",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21306360",
    "publication_date": "2026-07-11",
    "description": "<p>This is the reader-facing Emmy Noether working record for the Modern LaTeX Editions of Mathematics Manuscripts project. This version fronts <code>00_Noether_German_Cumulative_Working_SourceControl_R816_v18_20260711.pdf</code>, a 466-page German source-control reader, and supplies the integrated R814-R816/LocalCodex v18 TeX, audit ledgers, source witnesses, diffs, render checks, previous-base references, and build logs in <code>07_Noether_Current_SourceControl_Integrated_v18_R814_R816_20260711.zip</code>.</p><p><strong>What changed:</strong> the chain integrates Web/WebB R814-R816 and independent LocalCodex v14-v18 source passes on top of the former v12 public head. It resolves Paper 19 family notation; repairs Paper 31 diagonal-matrix and congruence notation; restores Paper 32 coefficient-index hierarchy, a coherent ell-family, and an explicit product dot; and repairs two Paper 34 source-fidelity/proof loci. The newest v18 pass restores the source-printed p658 reading <code>r_1' + r_2'</code> after an earlier silent mathematical emendation, and restores the omitted p659 containment and intermediate ideal that constitute the proof. The v18 ZIP contains full-resolution source witnesses, focused crops, before/after renders, exact diffs, page dispositions, adjudication notes, cumulative ledgers, and the current TeX/PDF/TXT.</p><p><strong>Status caveat:</strong> this is a serious source-repair and translation working corpus, not OCR-only, but it is not a critical edition, whole-corpus source-faithfulness certification, paper-by-paper certification, multilingual synchronization, or publication-grade proofreading. The retained English and multilingual readers predate some German source-control repairs and remain unsynchronized working translations. Filenames containing <code>COMPLETE</code> are inherited local-task labels only.</p><p><strong>GitHub:</strong> corrections, source comparisons, LaTeX fixes, and translation improvements can be suggested via issues or pull requests at <a href=\"https://github.com/KokunoYumeto/modern-latex-manuscripts\">https://github.com/KokunoYumeto/modern-latex-manuscripts</a>.</p>",
